mindmap
  root((.        RWA Blockchain))
    User
      Initiates transactions
      Owns and manages tokenised assets
      Interacts with smart contracts via wallet
    Smart Contract
      Executes core business logic
      Manages token lifecycle and transfers
      Invokes compliance, oracle, and audit modules
    KYC Oracle
      Verifies identity and AML status
      Issues verifiable credentials or proofs
    Jurisdiction Engine
      Determines regional policy applicability
      Evaluates cross-border rules and eligibility
    Data Oracle
      Supplies market data and proof-of-reserve
      Ensures on-chain representation of verified data
    Regulator / Audit Node
      Reviews compliance records and transaction logs
      Validates zero-knowledge proofs and audit data
    Governance DAO
      Votes on protocol changes and funding
      Elects auditors and manages treasury
    Compliance Log Database
      Stores immutable compliance metadata
      Provides transparency and traceability for audits
